/S /P
/E ( In another case, I worked with a child who had significant leg length discrepancy. We used the Juggle Board with the feet. Our goal was to activate the shorter leg, which had limited movement due to an orthosis and was underused in daily life. After we found the right position, the child played using only the affected leg.)
/Pg 19 0 R
>>
