/S /P
/E ( We also played with the Juggle Board using feet only with a child who had underdeveloped body awareness and body image. This child barely acknowledged the existence of his legs and had difficulty moving them independently. He instinctively tried to reintroduce his hands during play, even though the activity focused on the legs.)
/Pg 19 0 R
>>
