<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (The Monokyklo team, along with other interested individuals, attended the "Functional Juggling" seminar led by Craig Quat in Thessaloniki. Following the seminar, our trainers volunteered at various Disability Daycare Centers \(DDCs\) across the city. Their goal was to apply the practical tools of Functional Juggling with individuals of all ages and with diverse disabilities, working one-on-one with each participant.)
/E (The Monokyklo team, along with other interested individuals, attended the "Functional Juggling" seminar led by Craig Quat in Thessaloniki. Following the seminar, our trainers volunteered at various Disability Daycare Centers \(DDCs\) across the city. Their goal was to apply the practical tools of Functional Juggling with individuals of all ages and with diverse disabilities, working one-on-one with each participant.)
/Pg 30 0 R
>>
endobj
