779 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2231 0 R
/E (Participants were drawn to bright colours and structured patterns, and although creating new sequences was challenging, most persisted and succeeded with guidance)
/Pg 31 0 R
>>
endobj
780 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ( Familiar educators played a crucial role. When participants were supported by someone they trusted, focus, engagement, and joy all increased. Tools that incorporated colour and number coding proved especially effective.)
/Pg 31 0 R
>>
