1009 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T ( The project was guided by a simple yet powerful principle: children are exposed to a wide variety of movement experiences in a playful setting. The pedagogical approach emphasized equality, eye-level interaction, and the creation of a low-pressure, exploratory atmosphere. Success was defined not by performance, but by engagement, curiosity, and the freedom to try, fail, and try again.)
/E ( The project was guided by a simple yet powerful principle: children are exposed to a wide variety of movement experiences in a playful setting. The pedagogical approach emphasized equality, eye-level interaction, and the creation of a low-pressure, exploratory atmosphere. Success was defined not by performance, but by engagement, curiosity, and the freedom to try, fail, and try again.)
/Pg 43 0 R
>>
endobj
