<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ( The project also illustrates the value of a highly structured yet flexible pedagogical approach in working with children with diverse and complex needs. The combination of proactive planning, systematic individualization, and the willingness to adapt methodologies in response to direct participant feedback were critical to the project's positive outcomes. It demonstrates that even within a short timeframe, targeted and needs-oriented interventions can facilitate meaningful engagement and observable progress.)
/Pg 50 0 R
>>
